# Every line here parses. Semantic analysis finds what is wrong with it.

SUBJECT admin, guest, analyst, contractor      # W106 contractor is never used

RESOURCE database SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE reports  SUPPORTS READ
RESOURCE backups  SUPPORTS READ               # W106 backups is never used

ALLOW admni WRITE database                     # S001 typo in subject name
ALLOW analyst WRITE reports                    # S003 reports is read-only
ALLOW admin READ logs                          # S002 logs was never declared

ALLOW admin READ database
ALLOW admin READ database                      # W101 duplicate

DENY guest ACCESS database
ALLOW guest READ database WHEN authenticated   # W104 the DENY above always wins

ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN authenticated
DENY analyst READ reports WHEN on_public_wifi  # W103 conflict when both hold
